[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":91},["ShallowReactive",2],{"/carlos3/projects/kora":3},{"id":4,"title":5,"body":6,"description":6,"extension":7,"meta":8,"navigation":86,"path":87,"seo":88,"stem":89,"__hash__":90},"projects/projects/kora.json","Kora",null,"json",{"order":9,"name":10,"year":11,"thumb":12,"slug":13,"relacionados":14},2,"Kora Living","2025","/carlos3/img/kora.jpg","/kora",{"1":15},[16,39,46,50,61,64,77],{"comp_type":17,"comp_var":18,"class":19,"html":20,"imgs":23,"cards":26,"link":38},"hero","base","project__hero",[21],{"title":10,"description":22},"Kora Living is a hospitality group with properties across Spain. I work in-house as the developer behind their digital ecosystem — koraliving.com, the individual resort sites, and Kategora's digital products — building on the foundation laid by \u003Ca href=\"https://www.somoscuchillo.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Cuchillo\u003C/a>.",[24],{"ruta":12,"alt":25},"Kora Living — project hero image",[27,30,33,36],{"text":28,"class":29},"Bilbao","Place",{"text":31,"class":32},"Web","Type",{"text":34,"class":35},"Hospitality","Category",{"text":11,"class":37},"Year","https://koraliving.com/",{"comp_type":40,"comp_var":41,"imgs":42},"media","img",[43],{"ruta":44,"alt":45},"/carlos3/img/kora_greencity.webp","Kora green city landing page",{"comp_type":47,"comp_var":48,"description":49},"text","Left","Each property has its own site with its own needs. My job is to keep them coherent — same quality, same feel — while moving fast enough to ship new features and react to what the business requires.",{"id":51,"comp_type":52,"comp_var":53,"imgs":54},"grid1","grid","double",[55,58],{"ruta":56,"alt":57},"/carlos3/img/kora_team.png","Kora Living team page",{"ruta":59,"alt":60},"/carlos3/img/kora_talent.webp","Kora Living talent page",{"comp_type":47,"comp_var":62,"description":63},"Right","\u003Ca href=\"https://www.somoscuchillo.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Cuchillo\u003C/a> set a high visual bar. The work since then has been about meeting it every time something new gets built — new sections, new interactions, new integrations — without letting the experience slip.",{"id":65,"comp_type":52,"comp_var":66,"imgs":67},"grid2","triple",[68,71,74],{"ruta":69,"alt":70},"/carlos3/img/kora_urban.webp","Kora talent oportunities page",{"ruta":72,"alt":73},"/carlos3/img/kora_oportunities.webp","The Soul of the 911 — hero section",{"ruta":75,"alt":76},"/carlos3/img/kora_olea.webp","Kora Olea mobile footer",{"comp_type":78,"comp_var":79,"link":80,"description":81,"imgs":82},"related","project","/carlos3/projects/overshoot","The Overshoot",[83],{"ruta":84,"alt":85},"/carlos3/img/overshoot.png","",true,"/carlos3/projects/kora",{},"projects/kora","xloXg136cQMKRUF5HbGzRdi0jLYqICg_Cl3cQaQ6f_0",1777359078673]